{
  "provenance": "FLSUN T1 Pro on stock FLSUN OS (Klipper fork 1.0.1.5, Debian 10, RV1126), as it reports itself over /printer/objects/list, /printer/info and configfile",
  "notes": [
    "hostname is the stock 'FLSunT1Pro'.",
    "delta_calibrate is a config section only: it is absent from the object list, so an object_required on it rejects the real machine.",
    "box_light, locate_printing_gcode and display_status are FLSUN's own Klipper modules.",
    "macros.cfg carries a user _START_PRINT_VARS macro - the name the k2-improvements entry treats as definitive - on a delta that cannot be a K2.",
    "kinematics comes from configfile [printer]: this Klipper fork's toolhead status omits it."
  ],
